    "reviews": "\u201cI was initially captivated by the puzzle aspect of the game, but it's the details that help the game ooze charm.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe puzzle design is particularly impressive, with even the simplest looking levels requiring some surprisingly complex solutions. Highly recommended.\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe puzzles are actually thought-provoking...Prickle nails that sweet spot middle ground, with a clear learning curve and genuinely rewarding &quot;aha!&quot; moments\u201d<br>Cheezburger<br>",
